### Cryptographic requirements

Integrate with QHCE.

Evaluate and use the following algorithms according to their correct cryptographic purposes:

| Purpose | Algorithm |
|---|---|
| Hybrid key establishment | X25519 + ML-KEM-768 |
| Vault key encapsulation | ML-KEM-1024 |
| Digital signatures | Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65 |
| File encryption | AES-256-GCM |
| Key derivation | HKDF-SHA3-256 |
| Password derivation | Argon2id |
| Integrity hashing | SHA3-256 |

ML-KEM is for key encapsulation, not digital signatures.

ML-DSA is for digital signatures.

